# What zcli leaves out of the package it sends to Zerops.
#
# The package is the repository as it stands, minus whatever .gitignore already
# excludes. What remains still holds material no service builds from or runs on,
# and it is packed and uploaded once per service on every deployment. Measured
# on the run of 22 August 2026, packing the website's package took 86 seconds,
# and these directories were 54 MB of the 79 MB in it.
#
# Anything a build command reads belongs in the package, so only files that no
# build touches are listed here.

# The knowledge graph. Tracked on purpose, read by nothing at build time.
graphify-out/

# Repository history visualisation, its input and its output.
.gource/
mkgource/
